    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/d8f5250a99fbe4687493ec69907c7d64.avif?t=1752078093\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f4b09ed7bc42268eda63c3c7b8ec4213.avif?t=1752078093\" width=618 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care For Your Own Pet Slime!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you always wanted a pet slime that lives on your desktop? Now is the time to adopt a dungeon slime! They love food, attention, and of course being squished!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/adbe7b5f326a8248ee9fec2fee1cab0d.poster.avif?t=1752078093\" width=640 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/adbe7b5f326a8248ee9fec2fee1cab0d.webm?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/adbe7b5f326a8248ee9fec2fee1cab0d.mp4?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No slime wants to live in an empty room! Customize your slime pen with fun decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f81e1c6295395f1e77a08ee30a2dce53.poster.avif?t=1752078093\" width=640 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f81e1c6295395f1e77a08ee30a2dce53.webm?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f81e1c6295395f1e77a08ee30a2dce53.mp4?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy New Decorations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon shop updates daily - stop by to see what's new!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/deb93652b951458421e7171bc17a6da4.poster.avif?t=1752078093\" width=640 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/deb93652b951458421e7171bc17a6da4.webm?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/deb93652b951458421e7171bc17a6da4.mp4?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/d8f5250a99fbe4687493ec69907c7d64.avif?t=1752078093\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f4b09ed7bc42268eda63c3c7b8ec4213.avif?t=1752078093\" width=618 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care For Your Own Pet Slime!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you always wanted a pet slime that lives on your desktop? Now is the time to adopt a dungeon slime! They love food, attention, and of course being squished!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/adbe7b5f326a8248ee9fec2fee1cab0d.poster.avif?t=1752078093\" width=640 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/adbe7b5f326a8248ee9fec2fee1cab0d.webm?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/adbe7b5f326a8248ee9fec2fee1cab0d.mp4?t=1752078093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No slime wants to live in an empty room! Customize your slime pen with fun decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f81e1c6295395f1e77a08ee30a2dce53.poster.avif?t=1752078093\" width=640 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794220/extras/f81e1c6295395f1e77a08ee30a2dce53.webm?t=1752078093\" ty